                                "sense_id": "a7076e28-8d7a-3329-aa3e-4c75e982b180",
                                "text": "‘Hey, Bill, where′s Charles?’ / ‘Napoo.’ / ‘What?’ / ‘Yes. He was out on a listening post and lit a cigarette. Sniper got him.’"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
